---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy" description="Privacy policy and analytics disclosure for the Net Art Extinction Timeline.">
  <div class="container prose">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>

    <p>
      This site uses <strong>Matomo</strong> (<a href="https://matomo.org">matomo.org</a>), a
      free and open-source analytics platform, for aggregate visitor statistics. Matomo is
      <strong>self-hosted on infrastructure in Germany</strong> (Karlsruhe). No data is shared
      with third parties or transferred to third countries.
    </p>

    <h2>What is collected</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Truncated IP address</strong> — the final two octets are dropped before
        storage, so the recorded address cannot be traced back to an individual visitor.</li>
      <li>The page visited, time on page, and navigation path during the session.</li>
      <li>Referring URL (the page you came from).</li>
      <li>Browser type and version, operating system, screen resolution.</li>
      <li>Date and time of access.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>No cookies, no cross-session tracking</h2>
    <p>
      The tracker runs in <strong>cookieless mode</strong>. Returning visits are not linked across
      sessions; only a short-lived, non-persistent hash is used within a single visit.
    </p>

    <h2>Do Not Track</h2>
    <p>
      The Matomo instance honours the <strong>Do Not Track</strong> browser signal. If your
      browser sends DNT, no data about your visit is recorded at all.
    </p>

    <h2>Legal basis and retention</h2>
    <p>
      Processing is based on legitimate interest in low-impact, anonymised reach measurement to
      improve the site (Art. 6 (1) (f) GDPR). Raw visitor logs are automatically deleted after
      <strong>180 days</strong>.
    </p>

    <h2>Opt out</h2>
    <p>
      You can opt out at any time. Use the
      <a href="https://matomo.schuetze.io/index.php?module=CoreAdminHome&action=optOut&language=en">opt-out
      page</a> on the Matomo server, or enable Do Not Track in your browser.
    </p>

    <h2>Controller (Verantwortlicher, Art. 13 GDPR)</h2>
    <p>
      The controller responsible for data processing on this site is
      <strong>ZKM&nbsp;|&nbsp;Zentrum für Kunst und Medien Karlsruhe</strong>, Lorenzstraße 19,
      76135 Karlsruhe, Germany — <a href="mailto:info@zkm.de">info@zkm.de</a>. The
      Net Art Extinction Timeline is a ZKM open-source project maintained by Marc Schütze
      (Museums- und Ausstellungstechnik). Full legal notice: <a href="/impressum">Impressum</a>.
      Repository:
      <a href="https://github.com/zkmkarlsruhe/netart-extinction">github.com/zkmkarlsruhe/netart-extinction</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
